    "detailed_description": "<strong>Become a medieval monk and confront the demon that has haunted the Boar Lake village.</strong><br><br>Confront 21 demons, originating from 7 houses of sins. Find, recognize, decide and exorcise the demon! Overcome fear, battle the demons! Embark on the role of a medieval monk and collaborate with your brethren.<br><br><strong>FIND</strong><br>Find the place where a cursed object lies, locate the items you need that will assist you in identifying who you are dealing with!<br><br><strong>RECOGNIZE</strong><br>Perform tests that will help you determine the demon's identity. Always remember to look around you!<br><br><strong>DECIDE</strong><br>Choose in your journals which one of them is your selection.<br><br><strong>EXORCISE</strong><br>Take the cursed object to the chapel, perform the appropriate exorcism! Victory or death!",
